# Labeling package handoff

Status: preparation guidance only. No human staff, independent hidden corpus, rights review or access separation is claimed.

The curator should supply a dev pilot of six independently authored families to measure effort, then justify the promoted targets of 12 dev families/120 claims and 12 heldout families/120 claims. The selected evaluation needs at least 30 defects, 30 nondefects and 15 items per reported kind; insufficient denominators are inconclusive. Renamed mutations from one template are one family.

Deliver reviewable source-only snapshots, atomic inventories and separate preliminary labels to the actual human annotator. Keep each rationale and source evidence visible to that annotator. Preserve independent preliminary judgments and final human adjudication with dates; do not erase disagreement. Human hours are an estimate in the plan, not an assignment to Roy.

Before heldout access, the independent owner must deliver a digest-only seal, rights/ancestry receipt and proof of actual access separation. Keep source and gold outside this product tree. The tuner receives only dev material. The evaluator receives admitted source without labels, executes frozen methods, closes inference, then passes gold to the scorer. Exact code/dependency/prompt/model/packet/cap identities belong in the admitted lock and actual run record.

The source construction includes schemas and descriptive scoring, not a functioning human review service. Do not put fabricated gold, fake adjudication identities or made-up benchmark numbers into the repository. Required live extraction, single-pass model comparison, real Action artifact and independent product acceptance remain outstanding.
